'''Gormlaith Golden-Hilt''', a [[Skyrim:Nord|Nord]] [[Skyrim:CombatWarrior1H|warrior]], is an ancient hero currently residing in the [[Skyrim:Hall of Valor|Hall of Valor]] in Sovngarde. She was one of the warriors, along with [[Skyrim:Felldir the Old|Felldir the Old]] and [[Skyrim:Hakon One-Eye|Hakon One-Eye]], who fought against [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]], ultimately sending him forward through time using an [[Lore:Elder Scrolls|Elder Scroll]]. 

She and her compatriots later assist you in the final battle against Alduin in [[Skyrim:Sovngarde (place)|Sovngarde]]. Upon returning to Tamriel, her spirit can be summoned using the first word of the [[Skyrim:Call of Valor|Call of Valor]] [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|shout]].

She wears a set of [[Skyrim:Steel Plate Armor|steel plate armor]], minus the helmet, and defends herself with an [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Sword|ancient Nord sword]] and a [[Skyrim:Steel Shield|steel shield]], supplemented by a [[Skyrim:Long Bow|long bow]] with ten [[Skyrim:Steel Arrow|steel arrows]]. She knows these shouts: [[Skyrim:Dragonrend|Dragonrend]], [[Skyrim:Frost Breath|Frost Breath]], [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]], [[Skyrim:Ice Form|Ice Form]], and [[Skyrim:Become Ethereal|Become Ethereal]]. She can use the greater power [[Skyrim:Battle Cry|Battle Cry]] as well. However, when summoned with Call of Valor, she will only use [[Skyrim:Dismay|Dismay]] and Unrelenting Force in combat. 

When summoned, she will say, ''"I serve the Dragonborn."'' or ''"Lead me into battle."'' In combat, she will exclaim, ''"For the Dragonborn!"'', ''"For Sovngarde!"'', or ''"My sword will taste of your blood!"''

